text = "Controls & Gameplay Keybindings:

W / A / S / D = Move & Strafe
Shift = Sprint (Consumes Stamina)
Spacebar = Jump (or Ascend when Flight Mode is active)
Ctrl / C = Descend (when Flight Mode is active)
Mouse = Aim / Look Around
Left Click / Right Click = Shoot Energy Projectile
E = Interact / Open Supply Chest
I or Tab = Open Inventory & Chest Storage
F1 = Open Cheat Menu (God Mode, Infinite Speed, Flight, Multipliers)
V = Quick Toggle Flight Mode
F5 / F9 = Quick Save / Quick Load Game
Esc = Pause Menu & Settings"
